RooTV (formerly Xiaozhi TV) self-hosted server image (xiaozhi-tv)

This image contains:

- This project's server code (server/), MIT licence: /app/LICENSE.
- jsQR 1.4.0 (server/relay/assets/jsqr.js), Apache License 2.0:
  /app/server/relay/assets/LICENSE.jsqr.txt.
- The QR code encoder in server/relay/qr.py follows Project Nayuki's QR Code
  generator library, MIT licence (notice in that file).
- Python (python:3.12-slim base image), Python Software Foundation License.
- FFmpeg from Debian's "ffmpeg" package and its libraries, under the GNU GPL /
  LGPL as built by Debian. The corresponding source is available from Debian:
  https://packages.debian.org/source/bookworm/ffmpeg (apt-get source ffmpeg).
  The exact package versions in this image are listed in
  /usr/share/doc/*/copyright and by `dpkg -l` inside the container.
- tini and tzdata from Debian, under their own licences
  (/usr/share/doc/tini/copyright, /usr/share/doc/tzdata/copyright).

Not in the image: yt-dlp (Unlicense) and Deno (MIT) are downloaded into
/data/youtube/bin/ from their official GitHub releases only when YouTube
"local mode" is turned on (pinned versions and SHA-256).

The image ships no content: no channel list, no stream address, no playlist,
no cookies, no keys. Everything it plays is added by the person who runs it.
